    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your world is dying. After extreme weather has caused a powerful storm to destroy your home, you are now in search for one of the famous sanctuaries, a safe haven for all birds away from the rain. Follow Puddles in her journey through the dangerous forest before any predators find her and unravel a mysterious world now destroyed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities to easier traverse the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver dangerous obstacles and try to avoid certain death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and make your way to safety</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKYLIGHT INTERACTIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rainbound&quot; is an atmospheric 2D platformer  by Skylight Interactive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your world is dying. After extreme weather has caused a powerful storm to destroy your home, you are now in search for one of the famous sanctuaries, a safe haven for all birds away from the rain. Follow Puddles in her journey through the dangerous forest before any predators find her and unravel a mysterious world now destroyed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities to easier traverse the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver dangerous obstacles and try to avoid certain death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and make your way to safety</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKYLIGHT INTERACTIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rainbound&quot; is an atmospheric 2D platformer  by Skylight Interactive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Follow Puddles, a brave little swallow, in this atmospheric 2D platformer. In a world soon perished by extreme weather conditions you'll have to avoid dangerous obstacles and navigate the terrain in your search of a safe haven.",
